@baseUrl = http://localhost:5150

### Listar servicios disponibles (pre-cargados en memoria)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/services
Accept: application/json

### Obtener un servicio por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/services/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Accept: application/json

### Crear un nuevo servicio
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/services
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Diagnóstico Especializado",
  "description": "Revisión completa en 45 minutos.",
  "durationMinutes": 45,
  "price": 60.00
}

### Listar todas las citas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments
Accept: application/json

### Crear una cita (ajusta la fecha si es necesario para que sea futura)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serviceItemId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "customerName": "Ana García",
  "customerEmail": "ana@ejemplo.com",
  "scheduledAt": "2027-01-15T15:00:00Z",
  "notes": "Primera visita"
}

### Obtener una cita por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/{{appointmentId}}
Accept: application/json

### Confirmar una cita
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/confirm
Accept: application/json

### Reprogramar una cita
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/reschedule
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newScheduledAt": "2027-01-16T16:00:00Z"
}

### Cancelar una cita
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/{{appointmentId}}/cancel
Accept: application/json
